{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fwIuRWQz5C1792766815.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國工業活動擴張步伐升至逾四年高位。</p><p></p><p>標準普爾全球公布，美國製造業採購經理指數10月升至56，市場原本預期由9月的55.9輕微跌至55.5。</p><p></p><p>至於服務業採購經理指數10月報57.9，低過市場預期和9月數值。</p><p></p><p>綜合採購經理指數10月跌至57.6，但符合市場預期。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:53:27.137625+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T14:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T03:38:06.571770+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:47:36.404193+00:00","content_hash":"153ecf0a125118e8812c52b2499dfc98886075425a51f4f8bc7f1635764e9c42","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}